  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne ful beo, slea man hine, þæt him forberste se swéora; ⁊ gif he þæt ordal forbuge, gilde angylde þam agenan frian ⁊ landrícan XX óran ⁊ gá eft to þam órdale.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If then he is proved guilty, he shall be struck such a blow as shall break his neck. But if he evades the ordeal, he shall pay the value [of the goods] to their owner, and 20 ores to the lord of the manor, and shall thereafter go to the ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si tunc sit immundus, percutiatur, ut collum ei frangatur; et si uitet ordalium, reddat semel captale suum repetenti et terre domino uiginti oras et eat rursus ad ordalium.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
